{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、モンブランとアイスに埋もれたいと小さく呟いたら『窒息するわよ』と友人にマジレスされてなぜか謝ってしまった若月といいます、どうもです。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで始まりました、甘党代表の若月のブログ♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんいかがお過ごしですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8573826/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の写メはまた雰囲気変えてみたよ。最後に載ってますん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、では、本日のブログ内容は!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーはみんな自分の故郷の星があるらしいです。(笑)というお話。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時すでに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面倒臭い雰囲気凄いけど聞いてね。(笑)前にも触れたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん...[イチゴ星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん...[ベリー星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんご...[りんご星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時点で既にイチゴとベリーの二つの星の違いがいまいちよくわからないという有り様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更にこの話の発端は斉藤優里で、ゆったんに『あれ？今日もイチゴ星からきたの？』というとスイッチがはいって相当面倒なキャラになります。握手会で是非。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー...[バナナ星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなにバナナが好きなわけでもないけれども、何故かバナナ星。え？成り行き？.........そこにバナナがあったか((ry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中...[焼き肉星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本...[レバー星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あかん。肉。もう可愛いさのない領域にきてしまった。ちなみにななみんにおいては、最近[レバ刺し星]から移住してきたというではないか。え!!星って跨げるの!!!!!???とか細かいことはシーッ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川...[アボカド星]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうなんでもありよ。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、ノッテミタ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃぁ...若月は[タピオカ星]で♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すかさず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤優里『そんな星ないお。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぇ............(;□;)却下された..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、若月は大人しく日本出身にします。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いったいどこがボーダーラインなんだ。タピオカダメなら焼き肉らへんで止めてくれよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまぁ、なんとも下らないお話でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまり......結論は........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も乃木坂46は平和です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ、みんなばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼みんな、おやすみゅうみゅう♪／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8573826/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜goodnight♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、大事な告知"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/17/8573826/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月24日（水）静岡放送 19時〜21時「美食の祭典クイズで中国　いただきまーすSP」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいと二人で地元で頑張ってきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非ご覧くださいσ(o・ω・o)"}],"source":"archive"}